{"segs": ["PA_ja_115:0.2", "PA_ja_115:0.3"], "en": "Ekakanipāta, Haṃsavagga (The Book of the Single Verses, The Chapter on Swans)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_115:0.4"], "en": "5. The Anusāsikā Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_115:1.1", "PA_ja_115:1.2"], "en": "“She who instructs others while she herself behaves with greed;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_115:1.3"], "en": "\"Having ripened in the evening, she lies there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_115:1.4"], "en": "struck down by the wheel of the teacher.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_115:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the fifth Jātaka, the *Anusāsikajātaka*.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
